<div class="diagram" role="img" aria-label="Architecture: from SAP Sales Cloud account creation the user opens a SAPUI5 onboarding app through the BTP application router. It calls a CAP registry service with a stable contract, which picks a provider adapter by sales organisation. The ARES adapter for the Czech Republic calls the register through a BTP destination; other countries can add an adapter. Validated company data goes back to Sales Cloud. Scheduled CAP jobs use the same service to detect register changes, then sync Sales Cloud or create a review task, and a discovery job stores links between register companies and accounts.">
